      "summary": "The bill directs Commerce to establish an exclusion process for covered building products from duties above rates in effect on January 19, 2025, with 15\u2011day rulings for critical products and 60\u2011day rulings for others. It covers products and inputs used in single\u2011family and multi\u2011family housing, and excludes AD/CVD, section\u2011201 duties.",
